                      "fontFamily": "Source Han Sans CN",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "500"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "vMROq",
                      "name": "文字",
                      "fill": "#7F888C",
                      "content": "本节只定令牌与规则，具体过渡由 skill 按界面元素决定。",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Source Han Sans CN",
                      "fontSize": 11,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "XMm7B",
                  "name": "文字",
                  "fill": "#5F676C",
                  "content": "按用途选令牌，不按最接近的数值",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Han Sans CN",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "butXp",
                  "name": "文字",
                  "fill": "#5F676C",
                  "content": "开关不对称：下拉与模态 250 开 / 150 关，面板 400 开 / 350 关",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Han Sans CN",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "i59p4",
                  "name": "文字",
                  "fill": "#5F676C",
                  "content": "悬停进快：进入 250ms 以内，退出可更长、可带弹性",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Han Sans CN",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "NiJCX",
                  "name": "文字",
                  "fill": "#5F676C",
                  "content": "错位间隔 40ms，少量大块 80ms，总时长不超过 300ms",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Han Sans CN",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Bbkxv",
                  "name": "文字",
                  "fill": "#5F676C",
                  "content": "位移过 40px 显迟钝，向 8px 收",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Han Sans CN",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ibB53",
                  "name": "文字",
                  "fill": "#5F676C",
                  "content": "关闭与悬停退出永不加延迟；意图延迟只给打开",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Han Sans CN",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "DmSd1",
                  "name": "文字",
                  "fill": "#5F676C",
                  "content": "两者对称不拆开：页面切换、标签滑动、手风琴、图标与文字切换",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Han Sans CN",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "q33hs",
                  "name": "文字",
                  "fill": "#5F676C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "所有界面状态变化均有自然衔接：首次进入、返回、异步内容、展开、正文呈现、输入与保存反馈。设置外部入场250ms / 8px / 3px模糊，间隔40ms；退出时背景与组件共用整页快照150ms；内部快照不叠加局部入场。常规反馈150ms；展开与收起250ms，可连续反向。正文只对新增内容入场，流式定稿不重播。主页双向转场总400ms；背景和品牌3px模糊，输入框2px模糊；侧栏开400ms / 关350ms，连续居中。减少动态时直接呈现状态。\n运行中状态字形以soft-light混合自左向右扫光，周期2000ms；覆盖工作中、思考与工具调用，特殊组件仅右下角局部扫光。完成后停止；页面隐藏或离屏暂停；减少动态时保留静态状态。正文追加与定稿保持已读节点，不重复播放入场。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Han Sans CN",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
